  <p>Cells identify the job titles that typically operate at that intersection, with a qualifier:</p>
  <ul class="g7l-failures-list">
    <li><strong>Yes</strong>: the role&rsquo;s mandate directly includes this layer / function pair</li>
    <li><strong>Sometimes</strong>: depends on organization size, vertical, or scope of the specific role</li>
  </ul>

